gyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-03T11:30:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T19:27:01Z","closed_at":"2026-08-03T19:27:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7.1.stable\n- Reproducible in 4.8.dev [eda2a482e9ce82e4056cfffae0ea98c1954605a1]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.stable - Web - Single-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL ES 3 (Compatibility) - Radeon R9 200 Series, or similar -  (2 threads) - AudioWorklet (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhenever the web editor moves between different \"runtime contexts\", like when moving from the project manager to the editor or when shutting down the Game \"tab\", you end up with the following (normally minified) error being emitted into the devtools console:\n\n```\nUncaught RuntimeError: Aborted(Assertion failed)\n    abort https://localhost:8060/godot.editor.js:1\n    assert https://localhost:8060/godot.editor.js:1\n    runtimeKeepalivePop https://localhost:8060/godot.editor.js:1\n    checkIsRunning https://localhost:8060/godot.editor.js:1\n    MainLoop_runner https://localhost:8060/godot.editor.js:1\n```\n\nFor whatever reason this doesn't show up in Chrome (v153 unstable in my case), unless you run it through VS Code's `chrome` launch configuration. It does however show up just fine in Firefox (v153.0 in my case).\n\nAfter some investigation this appears to be a regression from #118771, as calling `emscripten_cancel_main_loop` followed by `emscripten_force_exit` is apparently broken in Emscripten currently (see upstream issue linked [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118771#issuecomment-5139148234)).\n\nOn the ChromeBook I've been testing with this also seems to have caused a memory leak of some sort every time you close the Game \"tab\", but providing hard evidence for that (outside of OS memory stats) has proven difficult, as the memory snapshots in devtools report no leaks whatsoever.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open https://editor.godotengine.org/releases/4.7.1.stable/ in Firefox.\n2. Open the Web Developer Tools.\n3. Create and load a brand new project.\n4. Note the `Uncaught RuntimeError` in the Web Developer Tools console as the editor loads.\n5. Create an empty scene and run it.\n6. Close the Game \"tab\".\n7. Note again the `Uncaught RuntimeError` in the Web Developer Tools console.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122054/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122054/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}